sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Retell as Retell custom-function runner
    participant API as FastAPI Failure Lab
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant UI as Engineering dashboard

    Note over Caller,UI: Failure Lab is enabled before the call
    Caller->>Retell: Confirm the selected appointment

    rect rgb(255, 244, 224)
        Retell->>+API: Attempt 1: book_appointment
        API->>API: Verify X-Retell-Signature
        API->>API: Derive idempotency key K
        API->>DB: Begin transaction
        DB-->>API: K does not exist and slot is open
        API->>DB: Insert APT-001 and idempotency record K
        API->>DB: Commit transaction
        API->>DB: Record created_then_response_delayed
        Note over API,Retell: The calendar succeeded, but its response is deliberately delayed
        Retell--xAPI: Retell timeout expires
    end

    rect rgb(232, 247, 238)
        Retell->>API: Attempt 2: retry same booking
        API->>API: Verify X-Retell-Signature
        API->>API: Derive the same key K
        API->>DB: Look up idempotency record K
        DB-->>API: Existing appointment APT-001
        API->>DB: Record duplicate_returned
        API-->>Retell: APT-001 confirmed as idempotent replay
    end

    Retell-->>Caller: Confirm APT-001 once
    UI->>API: Fetch sanitized events and appointments
    API->>DB: Read evidence
    DB-->>API: 2 attempts and 1 appointment
    API-->>UI: Shared key K and shared ID APT-001
    Note over UI: Display: 2 API attempts · 1 appointment · duplicate prevented

    API-->>-Retell: Delayed Attempt 1 response is no longer authoritative
